# Testing

## Layout

`test/` mirrors `lib/`. File names are `snake_case_test.dart`.

```
test/
  helpers/
    mock_http.dart      # MockApi: installs a MockClient into HttpClientHelper.clientFactory
    test_app.dart       # pumpTestApp(): MaterialApp.router + cubits + l10n + routerMain
    fixtures.dart       # sample JSON + ready-made models
  Bloc/                 # app_cubit_test.dart, language_cubit_test.dart
  Models/<Feature>/     # <x>_model_test.dart, <x>_api_test.dart
  Screens/<Feature>/    # <screen>_controller_test.dart, <screen>_test.dart (widget)
  Widgets/
  AppRoutes/
```

## Network

- Never hit the real network. Replace the client:

```dart
setUp(() => HttpClientHelper.clientFactory = () => MockClient((req) async {
      if (req.url.path.endsWith('/orders')) return http.Response(jsonEncode(ordersJson), 200);
      return http.Response('{"message":"not found"}', 404);
    }));
tearDown(() => HttpClientHelper.clientFactory = http.Client.new);
```

- Turn caching off in tests (`enableCash = false` / no `returnCaching`) and reset `SharedPreferences.setMockInitialValues({})`.

## What to test

| Layer | Test |
|---|---|
| Model | `fromJson` with full, partial, and wrong-typed JSON; `toJson` round trip; calculations |
| Api | correct url/method/body sent; success parses into `response.data`; 4xx/5xx/no-connection → `success == false` |
| Controller | inject fake Api functions/callbacks; assert fields after `onInit()`/actions; no widgets needed |
| AppCubit | emitted states and field values (`bloc_test` or `stream` + `expectLater`) |
| View | `pumpTestApp` + `MockClient`; loading → data, error → retry, empty state; one test per screen minimum |

## Rules

- Controllers/cubits take dependencies as constructor parameters with real defaults so tests pass fakes.
- Widget tests use `pumpTestApp` so `S.of(context)`, cubits, and `routerMain` exist.
- Use `pumpAndSettle` only when there are no infinite animations; otherwise `pump(duration)`.
- Reset globals (`routerMain`, `clientFactory`, prefs) in `tearDown`.
